{"step_index":60,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:41:28Z","input_tokens":2953,"cache_read_tokens":150513,"output_tokens":3986,"thinking":"Analyzing the data from `task-55`, the size of `sfx_engine_90s.wav` is 17,288,044 bytes, which corresponds to 90.0417 seconds of audio at 48,000 Hz, 16-bit stereo PCM. The synthesis time was 15.08 seconds, with the \"gearbox\" listed as 8-speed and 52 ups.\n\n\nInitial assessment shows audio synthesis results in desired power band and volume levels. The mixed audio file meets broadcast loudness targets after encoding. However, the balance between the sound effects and original music requires further investigation.\n\n\nThe audio mix adheres to the broadcast standard loudness target with balanced sound effects and music levels. Further checks confirm the mix's dynamic range and fade-out behavior aligns perfectly with the desired F1 broadcast style. The audio analysis indicates no further adjustments are needed.\n\n\nVerifying the functionality of the muxing scripts. The `mux_clay.sh` script, which builds all clay deliverables, executes successfully end-to-end in ~32 seconds. For the `f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4` video, the related muxing script's syntax will be validated and the optional `--sfx-only` flag will be tested.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/bin/bash\n# V5 合成：2161 帧 -> 1080p H.264（无声版 / 纯配乐版 / F1 V6 遥测引擎混音版）\n# 用法:\n#   bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh              # 完整生成无声版 + 纯配乐版 + 引擎混音版\n#   bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh --sfx-only   # 复用已有无声版，仅重制引擎音轨混音与 *_sfx_1080p.mp4\nset -e\n\nFF=/c/Users/86052/scoop/shims/ffmpeg.exe\nPY=$(command -v python || command -v python3)\nPROJ=\"D:/项目session/blender-supercar\"\nFR=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/frames\"\nAUD=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_90s.m4a\"\nSFX_WAV=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav\"\nSFX_MIX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a\"\nSILENT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_silent.mp4\"\nOUT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_1080p.mp4\"\nOUT_SFX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4\"\n\nif [ \"${1:-}\" != \"--sfx-only\" ]; then\n  # 1) 无声版\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -stats -y -framerate 24 -i \"$FR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 17 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -movflags +faststart \"$SILENT\"\n\n  # 2) 纯配乐版（After Hours / 108 BPM）\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$AUD\" \\\n    -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a aac -ar 48000 -ac 2 -b:a 192k -shortest \\\n    -movflags +faststart \"$OUT\"\nfi\n\n# 3) 遥测驱动 F1 V6 混合动力音效合成 + 配乐混音（AAC 256k, True Peak <= -1.0 dBFS, 末 1.5s 淡出）\nif [ ! -f \"$SFX_WAV\" ]; then\n  \"$PY\" \"$PROJ/pipeline/synth_sfx.py\"\nfi\n\n\"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$AUD\" -i \"$SFX_WAV\" \\\n  -filter_complex \"[0:a]aresample=48000,pan=stereo|c0=c0|c1=c0,atrim=0:90.041667,asetpts=PTS-STARTPTS,volume=-3.8dB,equalizer=f=600:t=q:w=1.3:g=-2.2,equalizer=f=2200:t=q:w=1.5:g=-1.6[mus];[1:a]highpass=f=68:poles=2,volume=-3.2dB,asplit=2[sfx_sc][sfx_mix];[mus][sfx_sc]sidechaincompress=threshold=0.14:ratio=2.6:attack=12:release=190:makeup=1[mus_duck];[mus_duck][sfx_mix]amix=inputs=2:normalize=0,afade=t=in:st=0:d=0.08,afade=t=out:st=88.541667:d=1.5:curve=qsin,alimiter=limit=0.81:attack=4:release=45:level=disabled[outa]\" \\\n  -map \"[outa]\" -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 \\\n  -movflags +faststart \"$SFX_MIX\"\n\n# 4) 正片 + F1 引擎音效混音版\n\"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$SFX_MIX\" \\\n  -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a copy -shortest \\\n  -movflags +faststart \"$OUT_SFX\"\n\nls -la \"$SILENT\" \"$OUT\" \"$SFX_MIX\" \"$OUT_SFX\"\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\mux_v5.sh"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/bin/bash\n# 白模成片合成：clay_frames -> 1080p H.264（无声版 / 纯配乐版 / F1 V6 遥测引擎混音版）\n# 用法:\n#   bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh            # 完整生成无声版 + 纯配乐版 + 引擎混音版\n#   bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh --sfx-only # 复用已有无声版，仅重制 *_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4\nset -e\n\nFF=/c/Users/86052/scoop/shims/ffmpeg.exe\nPY=$(command -v python || command -v python3)\nPROJ=\"D:/项目session/blender-supercar\"\nFR=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/clay_frames\"\nAUD=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_90s.m4a\"\nSFX_WAV=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav\"\nSFX_MIX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a\"\nSILENT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_silent.mp4\"\nOUT=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4\"\nOUT_SFX=\"$PROJ/renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4\"\n\nif [ \"${1:-}\" != \"--sfx-only\" ]; then\n  # 1) 白模无声版\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -stats -y -framerate 24 -i \"$FR/f_%04d.jpg\" \\\n    -c:v libx264 -preset slow -crf 18 -pix_fmt yuv420p \\\n    -movflags +faststart \"$SILENT\"\n\n  # 2) 白模纯配乐版（After Hours / 108 BPM）\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$AUD\" \\\n    -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a aac -ar 48000 -ac 2 -b:a 192k -shortest \\\n    -movflags +faststart \"$OUT\"\nfi\n\n# 3) 确保 F1 V6 引擎音轨与混音母带存在\nif [ ! -f \"$SFX_WAV\" ]; then\n  \"$PY\" \"$PROJ/pipeline/synth_sfx.py\"\nfi\n\nif [ ! -f \"$SFX_MIX\" ]; then\n  \"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$AUD\" -i \"$SFX_WAV\" \\\n    -filter_complex \"[0:a]aresample=48000,pan=stereo|c0=c0|c1=c0,atrim=0:90.041667,asetpts=PTS-STARTPTS,volume=-3.8dB,equalizer=f=600:t=q:w=1.3:g=-2.2,equalizer=f=2200:t=q:w=1.5:g=-1.6[mus];[1:a]highpass=f=68:poles=2,volume=-3.2dB,asplit=2[sfx_sc][sfx_mix];[mus][sfx_sc]sidechaincompress=threshold=0.14:ratio=2.6:attack=12:release=190:makeup=1[mus_duck];[mus_duck][sfx_mix]amix=inputs=2:normalize=0,afade=t=in:st=0:d=0.08,afade=t=out:st=88.541667:d=1.5:curve=qsin,alimiter=limit=0.81:attack=4:release=45:level=disabled[outa]\" \\\n    -map \"[outa]\" -c:a aac -b:a 256k -ar 48000 -ac 2 \\\n    -movflags +faststart \"$SFX_MIX\"\nfi\n\n# 4) 白模 + F1 引擎音效混音版\n\"$FF\" -hide_banner -loglevel warning -y -i \"$SILENT\" -i \"$SFX_MIX\" \\\n  -map 0:v -map 1:a -c:v copy -c:a copy -shortest \\\n  -movflags +faststart \"$OUT_SFX\"\n\nls -la \"$SILENT\" \"$OUT\" \"$SFX_MIX\" \"$OUT_SFX\"\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\mux_clay.sh"}}]}
